Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.68,0:00:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Giri Boy has returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.50,0:00:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What just happened to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.40,0:00:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.40,0:00:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't be able to get up, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.12,0:00:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though I lost the fight,\Nfor some reason I'm having fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.34,0:00:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Joy Boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.94,0:00:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy's Joy Boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.08,0:00:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that what Zunisha said?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.24,0:01:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What is he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.74,0:01:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I was starting to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.02,0:01:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Mr. Pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.00,0:01:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.44,0:01:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.60,0:01:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that you, Mr. Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.82,0:01:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It is him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.96,0:01:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.40,0:01:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat's up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.92,0:01:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.10,0:01:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So Kaido is lying after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.02,0:01:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're telling me that Ro is really okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.08,0:01:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.22,0:01:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We sacrificed one of our best agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.92,0:01:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And now Kaido is furious.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.74,0:01:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I still prefer it to the alternative.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.58,0:01:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We eliminated a risk factor like no other.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.30,0:02:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Although we can't know for certain\Nthis could have been a true disaster
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.38,0:02:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We must seize the Gum-Gum fruit. For\Nages, the world government has chased.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.08,0:02:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,after it and For ages it has eluded\Nour grasp what a joke we have allowed
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.60,0:02:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,this embarrassment To go on for\Ngenerations 800 years to be precise it's
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.24,0:02:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,quite vexing it sounds Foolish but\Nit's almost as if the fruit is trying
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.84,0:02:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,to evade us that's not Entirely
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.30,0:02:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,implausible Snow type devil fruits can
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.48,0:02:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,have a will of their own if that's\Nso this fruit Would be rather willful
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.46,0:02:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,after all its true name bears the title
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.80,0:02:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,of a god the Snow human human fruit
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.46,0:02:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Mythical type model
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.34,0:02:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Nika.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.18,0:02:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,From head to toe, his body was as\Nelastic as rubber itself, they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.14,0:03:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He fought and frolicked as he fancied,\Nbringing a smile to people wherever he went.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.50,0:03:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The warrior of liberation, or\Nas others called him, Nika,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.08,0:03:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,the sun god.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.26,0:03:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The fruit's awakened power is said to\Nimpart even greater might to its holder.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.88,0:03:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,but what it truly grants is freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.88,0:03:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Strength as broad as the imagination,\Nthe most ridiculous power in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.58,0:03:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,one that we could not contain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.78,0:03:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Komurasaki is Hiyori!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.06,0:03:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.94,0:03:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I loved Odin too, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.16,0:04:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's rethink this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.76,0:04:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido exploited me, but those\Ndays are all behind us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.02,0:04:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So please, pull out this nail.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.54,0:04:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can help us both escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.28,0:04:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would listen to you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.44,0:04:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You think me a fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.46,0:04:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My father, he kept his promise to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.96,0:04:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He trusted you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.00,0:04:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You told him that Kaido would leave,\Nthat you would free the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.96,0:04:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He spent five years playing the\Nfool and dancing as you asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.90,0:04:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He never made a single\Nexcuse to his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.20,0:04:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He honored your conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.90,0:05:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he believed that you'd keep\Nyour word and set everyone free.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.40,0:05:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So he withstood boiling oil for an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.64,0:05:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He allowed himself to be cooked alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.76,0:05:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He always, always had a smile on his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.66,0:05:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But the whole nation was taken hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.10,0:05:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And he was carrying that burden\Nall by himself in silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.50,0:05:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine the pain he felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.82,0:05:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Hiyori?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.36,0:05:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, are you okay with\Npeople talking bad about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.34,0:05:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't bother me one bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.42,0:05:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.62,0:05:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I have you, my family. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.28,0:05:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I want to stay with you forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.40,0:05:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.26,0:06:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That Odin was one hell\Nof a samurai, wasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.04,0:06:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,As shogun, I can give him a posthumous\Naward, or perhaps a monument.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.92,0:06:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the shogun's daughter, Kozuki Hiyori.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.18,0:06:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,When you speak to me, mind your tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.88,0:06:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Even when I was starving,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.94,0:06:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,even when I was dressed in rags,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.68,0:06:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I carried with me the honor that\Nmy father brought to our name.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.80,0:06:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You have never been a\Nshogun a day in your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.54,0:06:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a\Nthief and an imposter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.00,0:06:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a lowly worm and a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.50,0:06:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And the longer you live your\Npathetic excuse of a life,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.70,0:06:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,the more innocent people die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.36,0:06:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Please have mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.74,0:06:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.12,0:06:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't lay a finger on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.54,0:06:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Revenge is meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.18,0:06:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.34,0:07:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Killing me is pointless. It still\Nwon't get rid of Dock, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.58,0:07:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Orochi
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.32,0:07:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I have failed you, my task?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.42,0:07:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Contero, is it really you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.06,0:07:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Alas, I'm finished, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.90,0:07:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, you're just in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.86,0:07:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, there's a new stage\Nfor you right before me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.96,0:07:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Burn this bitch to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.28,0:07:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, my friend, and make it quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.18,0:07:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A woman who endured for 20 years\Nfails to get her revenge in
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.16,0:07:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,the end it's a tragic comedy for\Nthe ages I tell you do you get
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.84,0:07:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,it now you're just a relic of
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.20,0:07:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kozuki Kyori, the chosen, the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.04,0:07:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,strong like me we are blessed\Nwith fortune from heaven itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.54,0:07:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.40,0:08:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you coming this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.10,0:08:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Conqueror, you imbecile!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.14,0:08:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Iori, you have to help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.56,0:08:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The dawn, it will surely come.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.58,0:08:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kozuki clan always\Nkeep their promises.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.24,0:08:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do everything I ever wanted!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.10,0:08:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup, I think I can get back to the fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.10,0:08:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, my heartbeat sure sounds funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.60,0:08:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.48,0:08:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.58,0:08:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my peak!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.64,0:08:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.12,0:09:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is everybody passing out?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.72,0:09:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we getting hit with Conqueror's Haki?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.08,0:09:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's it coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.04,0:09:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.38,0:09:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something up there...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.28,0:09:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,on the roof!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.44,0:09:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.72,0:09:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that really Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.76,0:09:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oofy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.26,0:10:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey-dead muscles! Muscles!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.26,0:10:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.94,0:10:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And look!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.42,0:11:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.76,0:11:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.60,0:11:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.76,0:11:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Blast Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.76,0:11:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.44,0:11:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.62,0:12:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.70,0:12:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.50,0:12:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.41,0:12:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.14,0:12:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Mummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.94,0:12:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Karoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.76,0:12:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Fifth gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.64,0:12:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My apologies for what\Nthat fool did to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.76,0:13:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to win that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.48,0:13:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.52,0:13:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.92,0:13:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to settle this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.66,0:13:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, aren't you full of surprises?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.56,0:13:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I was certain you had died.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.84,0:13:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.52,0:13:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, seems your rubber power is\Naffecting things outside of yourself now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.90,0:13:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I assume this means your parametheal\Npowers have reached their awakening,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.98,0:13:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,but your body changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.08,0:13:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.10,0:13:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost like you've gone\Nthrough a zolan transformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.72,0:14:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.90,0:14:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop eating me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.74,0:14:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Muscle... power!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.44,0:14:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, turn out the lights!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.64,0:14:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha! Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.76,0:14:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm like a shooting star!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.20,0:14:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Call me Lucy Satori!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.18,0:14:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm shooting through your body!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.22,0:15:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.74,0:15:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.26,0:15:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What a bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.02,0:15:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Kaido?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.56,0:15:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he flirting like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.40,0:15:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure, but he seems\Nto have put on weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.02,0:15:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's trying out a new form.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.54,0:15:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell is he doing this to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.60,0:15:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,My body's not made of rubber.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.78,0:15:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I sure am having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.24,0:15:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see two lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.48,0:16:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten seconds to launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.90,0:16:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.32,0:16:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.42,0:16:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.58,0:16:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.56,0:16:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, lift off!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.60,0:16:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go make a game for a game!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.56,0:16:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.95,0:16:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah! Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.24,0:16:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah. I mean
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.84,0:16:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,R. Have
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.98,0:17:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ann
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.36,0:17:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.72,0:17:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This time I got an even better idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.00,0:17:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Home combat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.90,0:17:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.98,0:17:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.92,0:17:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I even looking\Nat right now? That voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.68,0:17:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He sounds just like Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.20,0:17:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you think that thing is Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.86,0:17:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.90,0:17:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I got you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.34,0:18:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Blast red!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.94,0:18:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.85,0:18:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.10,0:18:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Diss — Suck him up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.00,0:18:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.90,0:18:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Comic-Con!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.04,0:18:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Conqueror of three!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.56,0:18:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.18,0:18:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ragnaraku!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.36,0:19:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.74,0:19:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.40,0:19:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he certainly looks different.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.80,0:19:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a damn comic strip?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.56,0:19:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You put on a good show, but it seems all\Nyou're running around wore you out already.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.72,0:19:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.98,0:19:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Your best isn't enough to beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.56,0:19:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.04,0:20:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I got plenty left in the tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.74,0:20:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I pooped.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.70,0:20:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.02,0:20:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.10,0:20:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.40,0:20:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We're halfway there anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.46,0:20:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder this wore me out so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.62,0:20:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You can die in peace this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.86,0:20:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The story of the battle you fought\Nwill be passed down for generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.96,0:20:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.24,0:20:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.96,0:20:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're dead, you're just...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.34,0:21:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,it really is him with those\Nwhite clothes in that white hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.26,0:21:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He looked like a different person.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.70,0:21:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried he's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.08,0:21:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But his voice is fading away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.10,0:21:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.86,0:21:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Cuz I'm still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.84,0:21:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta give one of\Na happy ending. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.12,0:21:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Momo right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.34,0:21:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,For Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.34,0:21:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,For Kin'emon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.34,0:21:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,For Pedro!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.34,0:21:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.34,0:21:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that supposed to scare me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.34,0:21:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't even be the first time today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.98,0:21:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.96,0:22:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Be louder for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.10,0:22:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.90,0:22:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.48,0:22:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.12,0:22:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.02,0:22:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.34,0:22:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.25,0:22:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.18,0:22:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.62,0:23:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.20,0:23:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.74,0:23:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.66,0:23:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is completely insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.70,0:23:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in a conqueror's Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.66,0:23:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This strange white transformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.78,0:23:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This freedom that seems to be\Nwarping the world around him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.34,0:23:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.56,0:23:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Up here, up here, follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.96,0:23:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're starting to get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.74,0:23:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yum, yum, caribou!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.84,0:24:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Feels like I'm playing\Ngames with a damn kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.10,0:24:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of this crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.54,0:24:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Three, two, one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.74,0:24:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.32,0:24:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.02,0:24:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.82,0:25:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't fun yet, Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.24,0:25:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Woohoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.15,0:25:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That was strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.74,0:25:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It was really funny too!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.98,0:25:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I can't make up my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.42,0:25:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what should I call that technique?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.20,0:25:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum something.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.18,0:25:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum blah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.48,0:25:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum blah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.88,0:25:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you still, Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.84,0:25:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.44,0:25:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.94,0:25:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Joy Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.50,0:25:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Joy Boy, how long it's been\Nsince I've felt this rhythm.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.60,0:25:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me, Joy Boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.82,0:25:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels as if you're right beside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.36,0:26:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart is dancing with excitement.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.02,0:26:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot help but feel\Nthat fate is at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.96,0:26:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot help but put my\Nfaith in this young man!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.70,0:26:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.10,0:26:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.32,0:26:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, the man who surpasses you,\Nand then become King of the Pirates!
